              "text": "His heart remained full of love until the end of his days.",
              "audioStart": 151.1,
              "audioEnd": 153.975
            },
            {
              "text": "People remembered his story for generations as a lesson in small and sweet feeling.",
              "audioStart": 154.838,
              "audioEnd": 159.238
            },
            {
              "text": "He always remembered to be nice to everyone he met along the road.",
              "audioStart": 160.1,
              "audioEnd": 163.3
            },
            {
              "text": "The sun shone down upon the green grass every single day.",
              "audioStart": 164.162,
              "audioEnd": 167.162
            },
            {
              "text": "He walked through the trees and looked at the beautiful sky above him.",
              "audioStart": 168.025,
              "audioEnd": 171.075
            },
            {
              "text": "Many people came from other towns just to see him and talk with him.",
