              "audioEnd": 179.012
            },
            {
              "text": "His life was full of peace and quiet joy in the forest.",
              "audioStart": 179.875,
              "audioEnd": 182.812
            },
            {
              "text": "The birds sang sweet songs while the wind moved through the leaves.",
              "audioStart": 183.675,
              "audioEnd": 186.812
            },
            {
              "text": "He knew that love was the most important thing in the world.",
              "audioStart": 187.675,
              "audioEnd": 190.35
